      <div type="clause" n="2">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:XAtr">X Atr</ref> 2</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ witena gerædnes is, þæt man rihte laga uppe arære ⁊ ælce unlaga georne afylle, ⁊ þæt man læte beon æghwylcne man rihtes wyrðe.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And the decree of the councillors is, that justice be promoted and every injustice zealously suppressed, and that every man be allowed the benefit of the law.</ab>
      </div>
